{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/68e3b0b221aafd3b4b6ca30ff3a03926.avif?t=1768317298\" width=1560 height=567 /></span>As the resurrected king, you and your best friend manage a single character! But one of you must take the right side of the body while the other takes the left! Even taking a step is challenging in this game. Will you be able to reach the castle and see the end of the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when taking steps. If you and your friend don't get along while completing your tasks, different surprises await you. Progress towards the castle through levels filled with different mechanics and puzzles, and try to maintain a close relationship with your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to complete levels with funny dialogue and a fun story while enjoying the 3rd-person puzzle platformer experience. Use a single body to complete challenging courses with your friend. Can you complete levels with different mechanics and tools, sometimes using arrows and bows, sometimes using just an apple?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns; if you step all at once, you'll fall to the ground. You won't be able to take a single step unless you and your friend become one body! You must keep pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of you can kick while lifting your foot. This way, you can break various environmental elements. It's also pretty fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f0b2944109fb74275ab1d4776ed6070b.avif?t=1768317298\" width=504 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move your arms independently of your friend and can grab and throw objects. However, to use some tools you'll need to work together. Now try doing that while walking together. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974210?t=1768317298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/a48dbb015dca5a49aab15688b9a5c182db74b85d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768317298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/b1b0ee69f8ee713eb853f431b8a4e10c8f3a9a4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768317298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/b1b0ee69f8ee713eb853f431b8a4e10c8f3a9a4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768317298","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/68e3b0b221aafd3b4b6ca30ff3a03926.avif?t=1768317298\" width=1560 height=567 /></span>As the resurrected king, you and your best friend manage a single character! But one of you must take the right side of the body while the other takes the left! Even taking a step is challenging in this game. Will you be able to reach the castle and see the end of the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when taking steps. If you and your friend don't get along while completing your tasks, different surprises await you. Progress towards the castle through levels filled with different mechanics and puzzles, and try to maintain a close relationship with your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to complete levels with funny dialogue and a fun story while enjoying the 3rd-person puzzle platformer experience. Use a single body to complete challenging courses with your friend. Can you complete levels with different mechanics and tools, sometimes using arrows and bows, sometimes using just an apple?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns; if you step all at once, you'll fall to the ground. You won't be able to take a single step unless you and your friend become one body! You must keep pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of you can kick while lifting your foot. This way, you can break various environmental elements. It's also pretty fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/extras/f0b2944109fb74275ab1d4776ed6070b.avif?t=1768317298\" width=504 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move your arms independently of your friend and can grab and throw objects. However, to use some tools you'll need to work together. Now try doing that while walking together. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Psps Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/c26d47de5a92c30dfeec53068cecf6cc255f2042/header.jpg?t=1768317298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974210/1453289873/717c5d87310b89b83217c02