ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974210/db72bb167dd9fa6092825595518e9a3e0d605fec/ss_db72bb167dd9fa6092825595518e9a3e0d605fec.600x338.jpg?t=1768317298"}],"short_description":"Are you ready to share a body with your best friend? Enjoy the fun story while playing a 3rd person puzzle-platformer game. As two frogs, take separate control of the left and right bodies of a resurrected king and navigate challenging courses to reclaim your throne!","steam_appid":3974210,"support_info":{"email":"psps.gamestudios@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}